  "_note": "GUITION ESP32-4848S040 common C_I display/touch configuration, ESP32-S3 with 16 MB flash and 8 MB octal PSRAM. Original stylised front view plus a labelled rear H1 connector inset; not a mechanical drawing or a breadboard footprint. Only the actual H1 header is exposed. P1 duplicates UART0/GND/5V. GPIO is 3.3 V logic, not 5 V tolerant; 5v is board power, not a GPIO reference. Optional relay/audio assembly uses GPIO40/2/1 and is not represented. Internal LCD/touch/SD/memory pins are metadata, not expansion terminals. See docs/pin-table-esp32-4848s040.md.",
